                "condition": "first_run",
                "beat": "exit",
                "actorId": null,
                "expression": null,
                "text": "Unlock hidden achievement `醒來時，水已經涼了`; Mia research stops, baseline market medicine remains; 伊萊 enters the first-run confidence-collapse state."
